                                 ।
experiences and findings from the pre-test, the
CAPI version of the questionnaire is finalized.
Eventually, after a series of the aforementioned
processes, the questionnaire is placed before the
PIC’s meetin g, and ultimately finalized,
accumulating the suggestions in the
questionnaire, received from the meeting.
